            `Lambda functions must be written in the form of x => expression, where:`,
            `- x represents a value passed in by the system. The type of the value varies in different contexts. You can rename x to improve readability.`,
            `- expression is a expression in which you can use x and its interface. The expected type the evaluation result of the expression varies in different contexts.`
